      "claim": "A parent reports that chat can be set to friends only or turned off to limit unmonitored interactions.",
      "stance": "mitigation",
      "quote": "For younger kids and even tweens and teens, consider setting chat to \"friends only\" or turning it off completely. This helps ensure that only trusted people can reach them."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D526]",
      "area": "contact",
      "claim": "A parent reports that strangers can request personal details or move chats to other platforms, which are red flags.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "Explain to your child that if someone asks to chat on another app or platform, or if they request personal details, these are red flags."
    },
